DerenguhGram-Client licensing

This repository contains additive modules for two upstream projects with different
licenses. Each module inherits the license of the upstream it integrates into:

* desktop/  — GNU GPL v3 (inherited from telegramdesktop/tdesktop).
              SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
* android/  — GNU GPL v2 or later (inherited from DrKLO/Telegram).
              SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later

When you distribute a built fork, you must comply with the corresponding upstream
license and publish your source code. Do not use the Telegram name or logo in a way
that implies official endorsement; make clear that DerenguhGram is unofficial.

Full license texts:
  GPLv3: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt
  GPLv2: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.txt
